sCinema(oHoopz,"dialog","Thanks for saving me, dad. I don't know what Mr. Jordan would have done to me if you didn't come but... but he's not a good man, dad.",1);
sCinema(oBarkley,"dialog","I know, Hoopz. He's one of the bad guys and I promise I won't let him do anything to you.",1);
